#: ../../cloud_host.rst:8
msgid "Similar to a Data-Center MSP-Hosted environment, CentreStack has a Cloud version that is readily hosted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../cloud_host.rst:10
msgid "This works well for managed service providers who have smaller clients here and there. Because of the smaller number of total clients, the Data-Center MSP-Hosted overhead is relatively high. MSPs can use the Cloud version since it is readily deployed and ready to use."
msgstr ""

